<title>PHILIPPINES: Jardine to form jv with Australian firm.</title>
<headline>Jardine to form jv with Australian firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Jardine Davies Inc said on Wednesday it had agreed to form a joint venture company with Cyrine Trading Pte Ltd to provide computer data services.</p>
<p>Cyrine is a wholly owned subsidiary of Salmat Pty Ltd of Australia.</p>
<p>The new company, to be called Jardine Salmat Corp, said it would provide printing services, customer database development, management and associated computer services, data scanning and retrieval and generation of mailing lists.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
